  <description>
    Trial copy of blueboat_29July2026 that declares its PBR maps explicitly in
    SDF (external PNGs) instead of relying on the material embedded in the GLB,
    to test whether that fixes the bright-facet shading artefacts under Ogre2.
    Normal map deliberately omitted - see model.sdf.
  </description>
</model>
